          "text": "{\"regions\":{\"r2\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"to a forest considering all this as unstable as the shadow of a\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"small lamp flickering in the wind ( caused by the wings ) of\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"a moth madly falling upon it.\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r3\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"82. O friend, while searching this triple world as far as\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"worldly life prevails, none such has come within the range of\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"our sight or hearing as can easily become (lit. possesses the\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":4,\"text\":\"facility of becoming ) the post for fastening, by means of\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":5,\"text\":\"self-restraint, the elephant of the mind intoxicated by the\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":6,\"text\":\"deep-seated and secret attachment for the female elephant in\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":7,\"text\":\"the form of the sensual objects.\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r4\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"83. Though reflecting for a long time, I do not know of\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"what great penance this is the result,\u2014viz. this rambling\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"at will, this meal free from humiliation, the company of\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":4,\"text\":\"the noble, this learning having for its fruit ( the observance\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":5,\"text\":\"of ) the one vow of controlling the senses, and the mind\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":6,\"text\":\"moving ( but ) slowly towards external objects.\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r5\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"84. Desires have already been absorbed ( by reason of\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"non-fulfilment ) in the heart; youth has passed away; and\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"alas ! in the absence of appreciaters of merit, skill ( lit. qua-\",\"end\":\"hyphen\"},{\"n\":4,\"text\":\"lifications ) in the ( different ) limbs has proved fruitless;\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":5,\"text\":\"relentless and powerful death, the all-destroyer, comes sud-\",\"end\":\"hyphen\"},{\"n\":6,\"text\":\"denly: what is to be done ( lit. proper )? Ah I have it; except\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":7,\"text\":\"bearing ( resorting to ) the two feet of the destroyer of\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":8,\"text\":\"\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":9,\"text\":\"cupid ( S'iva ) there is no other recourse.\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r6\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"85. Between Mahes'vara, the Lord of the worlds and\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"Jan\u00e2rdana, the Pervading Spirit of the universe, I have no\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":4,\"text\":\"conception of any difference; still I am strongly drawn\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":5,\"text\":\"to the new-moon-crested God.\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r7\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"86. On nights with all sounds hushed up, sitting at\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"ease somewhere on the sandy bank of the heavenly river, the\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"surface of which ( bank ) is whitened by the brilliant flood\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":4,\"text\":\"of moonlight, and grown despondent on account of the\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":5,\"text\":\"wearisomeness ( lit. magnitude or expansiveness ) of worldly\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r1\":{\"type\":\"page_number\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"[ 41 ]\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null}},\"units\":[{\"id\":\"u1\",\"type\"